#    discount matters more here than it looks: the alloy is a ~14KB prefix re-sent every turn
#    (the runtime persists `instructions` and replays them), so the cacheable share of a long
#    thread is large. See the correction below.
#
# 3. LINEAGE. It is the same family and generation as the model this replaces, which is the
#    weakest of the three reasons and is recorded as lineage, not as evidence.
